# {{project_name}}

A SEP-41 fungible governance token contract (`soroban_sdk::token::TokenInterface`)
with on-chain vote delegation and historical ledger checkpoints, generated by
[soroban-forge](https://github.com/soroban-forge-labs/soroban-forge) from the
`governance-token` template.

## Features

- **SEP-41 Token Interface**: `transfer`, `transfer_from`, `approve`/`allowance`
  (with expiration ledger), `burn`, `burn_from`, `balance`, `decimals`, `name`,
  `symbol`, plus admin-gated `mint` and `total_supply`.
- **Vote Delegation**: Holders call `delegate(account, delegatee)` (including
  self-delegation) to assign their voting weight. Token movements (`mint`,
  `transfer`, `transfer_from`, `burn`, `burn_from`) automatically move voting
  power between the sender's and recipient's delegates.
- **Checkpointed Past-Votes Lookup (Binary Search)**: Every change to a
  delegate's voting power or to `total_supply` writes a ledger-numbered
  checkpoint (coalescing multiple changes in the same ledger). Governance
  contracts query `get_past_votes(account, ledger)` and
  `get_past_total_supply(ledger)` via binary search so flash-loaned or
  transferred tokens cannot vote twice on the same proposal.

## Develop

```sh
cargo test
stellar contract build
```

## Deploy to testnet

The constructor takes `admin`, `decimals`, `name`, `symbol`:

```sh
stellar contract deploy \
  --wasm target/wasm32v1-none/release/{{crate_name}}.wasm \
  --source-account <your-identity> \
  --network testnet \
  -- --admin <ADMIN_ADDRESS> --decimals {{token_decimals}} --name "{{token_name}}" --symbol {{token_symbol}}
```

